'''Rangthang''' was a four-armed [[Gender|male]] [[DJ (occupation)|DJ]] who served the [[Hutt Clan]] during the [[Clone Wars]]. He was present when [[Jedi Master]]s [[Quinlan Vos]] and [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] came looking for [[Ziro Desilijic Tiure|Ziro the Hutt]].<ref name="Hunt for Ziro" />

